        {
          "_key": "k000de",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before and after school care for working parents"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000df",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000dg",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "School gets out long before most shifts end. Our after school program gives school-age children a safe, familiar place to go, with people who know them. Children up to 13 can come "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000di",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k000dh"
          ],
          "text": "before school"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000dj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " from 6 am and after school until 11 pm, Monday to Saturday."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k000dh",
          "_type": "link",
          "internal": {
            "_ref": "service-before-school",
            "_type": "reference"
          },
          "linkType": "internal"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000dk",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000dl",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What kids do after school"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000dm",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000dn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "After a snack, children sit down for "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000dp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k000do"
          ],
          "text": "homework time"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000dq",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Staff help with reading and checking work, and keep kids on task so homework is done before you pick up. Then it is time to play: games, art, building and time with friends. Children who stay into the evening have dinner and settle down with calm activities."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k000do",
          "_type": "link",
          "internal": {
            "_ref": "service-homework-help",
            "_type": "reference"
          },
          "linkType": "internal"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000dr",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000ds",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Care on days off school and all summer"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000dt",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000du",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Many parents still work when school is closed. We offer full-day care on "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000dw",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k000dv"
          ],
          "text": "school closure days"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000dx",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " like holidays, breaks and snow days, and full-day "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000dz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k000dy"
          ],
          "text": "summer care"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000e0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
