          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " or "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000ed",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k000ec"
          ],
          "text": "book a tour"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000ee",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Tell us your child's school and your work schedule, and we will go over how the days would work. We accept "
